turkiye-iban

This package contains Turkish IBAN utilities and provider-code data derived
from the official public sources documented in the project repository.

The project is independent and is not affiliated with or endorsed by the
Central Bank of the Republic of Turkiye (TCMB) or any listed institution.

Designed and produced with Divan: https://github.com/trugurpala/divan
Divan is not a runtime dependency.
